    airo:evidenceText "[9436] Tesla warns that drivers need to keep their eyes on the road and hands on the wheel at all times, though the automaker has declined to include a more robust driver-monitoring system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/07d5e240fb4c> a airo:Evidence ;
