<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/704c7b70d1b7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The fatal accident in 2019 occurred when Kevin George Aziz Riad, 27, was driving a Tesla Model S at 74 mph in Gardena, Los Angeles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1539" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/71a67d2ff0ac> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They have alleged negligence by Riad and have accused Tesla of selling defective vehicles that can accelerate suddenly and that lack an effective automatic emergency braking system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7226b9cc2a70> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1539] The fatal accident in 2019 occurred when Kevin George Aziz Riad, 27, was driving a Tesla Model S at 74 mph in Gardena, Los Angeles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1539" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/840eab7e30a0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla's Autopilot and Full Self-Driving features need \"active driver supervision\", does not make the car autonomous, and is intended for \"fully attentive\" drivers, the company says on its website." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1539" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8b6e93029061> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Felony charges are 1st in a fatal crash involving Autopilot" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97f321ed7eee> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "California prosecutors have filed two counts of vehicular manslaughter against the driver of a Tesla on Autopilot who ran a red light, slammed into another car and killed two people in 2019." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97fe63930f84> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's also tried to improve Autopilot's ability to detect emergency vehicles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ab41fd78eab7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[9435] The defendant appears to be the first person to be charged with a felony in the United States for a fatal crash involving a motorist who was using a partially automated driving system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b1deecd2c9cc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Kevin George Aziz Riad, 27, was exiting a highway in his black Model S when he ran through a red light, slamming into a Honda Civic and killing two people." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b6f9d45e9983> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The company has said that Autopilot and a more sophisticated \"Full Self-Driving\" system cannot drive themselves and that drivers must pay attention and be ready to react at any time." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b77e6c55b5cc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "By contrast, Autopilot and other driver-assist systems are widely used on roads across the world." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bdc5598b3416> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A judge in California has ruled that the driver of a Tesla Model S on Autopilot involved in the deaths of two motorists must stand trail for manslaughter." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9552" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cb4a6d6b56f6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla warns that drivers need to keep their eyes on the road and hands on the wheel at all times, though the automaker has declined to include a more robust driver-monitoring system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d9759d8bf92f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The defendant appears to be the first person to be charged with a felony in the United States for a fatal crash involving a motorist who was using a partially automated driving system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1322" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/db703d7c69e6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla owner is the first to face felony charges for deadly Autopilot crash" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/dec6dd6a79ae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In 1 crash report, the NTSB referred to its misuse as \"automation complacency.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e15201008ac3> a airo:Evidence ;
